"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"There is no complete award itinerary in these selected search results, so I can’t recommend a bookable award route yet. The useful next step is to verify the date-only award leads with the programs: each reports plenty of seats, but none gives a schedule, so connections and arrival times remain unknown. The main tradeoff among them is reported mileage versus reported fees—not a confirmed itinerary or a like-for-like total.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A12@2027-01-04/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"Alaska award lead — January 4\",\"v\":\"Reports economy between SFO and BKK on Alaska for 42,500 Alaska miles and USD 50.90 in award taxes; 8 seats are reported. This is the lowest mileage figure among these three selected leads, but it is a different program from the United options and has the highest reported USD fees among them. The result is date-only: verify the actual schedule, connections, availability, and exact quote scope before deciding.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A8@2027-01-03/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"United award lead — January 3\",\"v\":\"Reports economy between SFO and BKK on United for 60,500 United miles and USD 19.00 in award taxes; 9 seats are reported. Its reported fees are lower than the other two leads, but it requires more miles than the January 2 United lead. The result is date-only, with no schedule or connection details; confirm those and the current quote with United.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A5@2027-01-02/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"United award lead — January 2\",\"v\":\"Reports economy between SFO and BKK on United for 55,000 United miles and USD 24.50 in award taxes; 9 seats are reported. Compared with the January 3 United lead, it reports 5,500 fewer United miles but USD 5.50 more in fees. Neither result provides a schedule, so this mileage-versus-fee tradeoff does not establish which is the better trip; verify routing, timing, availability, and quote scope.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-01T22:55-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline — January 1\",\"v\":\"A separate cash option reports one stop via HKG on Cathay Pacific, departing SFO January 1 at 10:55 p.m. local and arriving in BKK January 4 at 10:35 a.m. local; elapsed time is 44 hours 40 minutes. The fare is USD 640.00, but its price scope is unknown, so it cannot be treated as a per-person or all-in comparison with the award fees. This provides one fully timed cash reference, not evidence that its price is the lowest across all cash fares.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"All three award leads fall within the requested January 2027 window, but they are partial results rather than complete itineraries. Points belong to their stated programs, and the USD award-tax quotes have unknown scope; don’t assume they are per traveler or party totals. Seat counts are reported, not a guarantee of current availability. The search was partial, with some route/date detail queries omitted and other queries limited, so these selected results do not establish the full set of available options. Confirm current award availability, schedules, routing, and fees directly with the relevant program before booking.\"}]}"
